[{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q1","number":1,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions use <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g=9.8\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></strong> Two particles, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass 5 kg and 3 kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely at the end of the string.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is 0.25.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the acceleration of the system.</p></li><li><p>Find the tension in the string.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-5\\times9.8 =0\\Rightarrow R=49\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF =0.25\\times49=12.25\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\rightarrow):\\quad T-12.25 =5a\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad3\\times9.8-T =3a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-12.25+29.4 =8a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{343}{160}=2.14\\text{ ms}^{-2}\\text{ (3 SF)}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2.1\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"T-12.25=5\\times\\frac{343}{160}\\Rightarrow T=\\frac{735}{32}=23.0\\text{ (3 SF)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Two particles, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass 12 kg and 5 kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely at the end of the string.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The two particles are accelerating at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0.02\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The system is released from rest.</p><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the tension in the string.</p></li><li><p>the coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table.</p></li></ol><p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is 0.5 m from the ground. Assuming that particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> does not reach the pulley,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li><p>find the time it takes for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to reach the ground.</p></li><li><p>state the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> travels in this time.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad5\\times9.8-T=5\\times0.02\\Rightarrow T=48.9\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=50\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\rightarrow):\\quad48.9-F =12\\times0.02\\Rightarrow F=48.66\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-12\\times9.8 =0\\Rightarrow R=117.6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n48.66 =117.6\\mu\\Rightarrow\\mu=\\frac{811}{1960}=0.414\\ldots\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu=0.41\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0.5=0+\\frac12\\times0.02t^2\\Rightarrow t=5\\sqrt2=7.07\\text{ seconds}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>7.1 s (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>0.5 m</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Two particles, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass 4 kg and 5 kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely at the end of the string.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q3.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is 0.4</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the acceleration of the system.</p></li><li><p>Find the tension in the string.</p></li></ol><p>The system is released from rest. It takes 1.05 seconds for Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to reach the ground and does not reach the pulley.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li><p>Determine the initial height of particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> above the ground.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-4\\times9.8 =0\\Rightarrow R=39.2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF =0.4\\times39.2=15.68\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\rightarrow):\\quad T-15.68 =4a\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad5\\times9.8-T =5a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-15.68+49 =9a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{833}{225}=3.70\\text{ ms}^{-2}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3.7\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"T-15.68=4\\times\\frac{833}{225}\\Rightarrow T=\\frac{1372}{45}=30.4888\\ldots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=30.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=30\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"s=0+\\frac12\\times\\frac{833}{225}\\times1.05^2\\Rightarrow s=2.04085\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"s=2.04\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"s=2.0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> metres (2 SF -- AQA)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q4","number":4,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions use exact values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g\" data-display=\"false\"></span></strong> Two particles, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass 2 kg and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely at the end of the string.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q4.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is 0.3</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the acceleration of the system in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Find the minimum value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is moving.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-2g =0\\Rightarrow R=2g\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF =0.3\\times2g=0.6g\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\rightarrow):\\quad T-0.6g =2a\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad mg-T =ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nmg-0.6g =(2+m)a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{mg-0.6g}{2+m}\\text{ ms}^{-2}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{mg-0.6g}{2+m}\\ge0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"mg-0.6g\\ge0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"m\\ge0.6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Minimum value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is 0.6</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q5","number":5,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions use <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g=9.8\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></strong> Two particles <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely with the string taut. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pulled away from the pulley with horizontal force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N with acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q5.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"P=(29.4\\mu+4a+9.8)m\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad T-9.8g=ma\\Rightarrow T=9.8m+ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-3m\\times9.8 =0\\Rightarrow R=29.4m\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF=\\mu R =29.4\\mu m\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\leftarrow):\\quad P-29.4\\mu m-T =3ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nP-29.4\\mu m-9.8m-ma =3ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nP =29.4\\mu m+4ma+9.8m\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nP =(29.4\\mu+4a+9.8)m\\text{ as req}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Two particles, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass 2 kg and 0.5 kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely at the end of the string. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is being pulled by a force of 10 N at an angle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"30^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to the horizontal away from the pulley.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q6.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is 0.2. Find</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>the frictional force acting on particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>the acceleration of the system.</p></li><li><p>the tension in the string.</p></li></ol><p>Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is swapped for particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"4\"><li><p>Find the maximum value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> accelerate upwards.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R+10\\sin30^\\circ-2\\times9.8=0\\Rightarrow R=14.6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"F=0.2\\times14.6=2.92\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=3.0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad T-0.5\\times9.8=0.5a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\leftarrow):\\quad10\\cos30^\\circ-T-2.92=2a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-4.9+5\\sqrt3-2.92=2.5a\\Rightarrow a=0.336\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=0.34\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"T-4.9=0.5\\times0.336\\Rightarrow T=5.07\\text{ N (3 SF)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=5.1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad T-m\\times9.8=ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\leftarrow):\\quad10\\cos30^\\circ-T-2.92 =2a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-9.8m+5\\sqrt3-2.92 =(2+m)a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow a =\\frac{-9.8m+5\\sqrt3-2.92}{2+m}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-9.8m+5\\sqrt3-2.92 &gt;0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n5\\sqrt3-2.92 &gt;9.8m\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nm &lt;0.5857402079\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is less than 0.586 kg (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is less than 0.59 kg (2 SF -- AQA)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Three boxes, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> have masses 2 kg, 8 kg and 0.5 kg respectively. Box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is hanging freely from a string, which passes over a small, fixed, smooth pulley and connects to box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is on a rough horizontal table. Box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is hanging freely from a string, which passes over a small, fixed, smooth pulley and connects to the other side of box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q7.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The coefficient of friction between box <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is 0.1. The system is moving.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the tension in the strings.</p></li><li><p>Find the acceleration of the system and describe the motion of the boxes.</p></li><li><p>State the modelling assumptions you have used.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad2\\times9.8-T_A=2a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-8\\times9.8 =0\\Rightarrow R=78.4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF =78.4\\times0.1=7.84\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\leftarrow):\\quad T_A-7.84-T_B =8a\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad T_B-0.5\\times9.8=0.5a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve simultaneously:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n19.6 =T_A+2a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-7.84 =-T_A+T_B+8a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-4.9 =-T_B+0.5a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nT_A =\\frac{1372}{75}=18.3\\text{ N}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T_A=18\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"T_B=\\frac{392}{75}=5.23\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T_B=5.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"a=\\frac{49}{75}=0.653\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=0.65\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (2 SF -- AQA)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is accelerating downwards</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is accelerating to the left</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is accelerating upwards</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The string is light, inextensible and taut. The boxes are modelled as particles.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.54-q8","number":8,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions use exact values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g\" data-display=\"false\"></span></strong> Two particles <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of mass <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"M\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> kg respectively, are attached by a light inextensible string over a small smooth peg. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> rests on a rough table. The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the table is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> hangs freely with the string taut.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q8.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The system is moving. Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"m\\ge\\mu M\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\uparrow):\\quad R-Mg =0\\Rightarrow R=Mg\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nF =\\mu Mg\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\rightarrow):\\quad T-\\mu Mg =Ma\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>On <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{R}(\\downarrow):\\quad mg-T =ma\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nmg-\\mu Mg =(M+m)a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{mg-\\mu Mg}{M+m}\\text{ ms}^{-2}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{mg-\\mu Mg}{M+m}\\ge0\\Rightarrow mg-\\mu Mg\\ge0\\Rightarrow mg\\ge\\mu Mg\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore m\\ge\\mu M\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]